-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----
Copy your AWS IoT Thing's private key here (the "xxxxxxxxxx-private.pem.key"
file AWS gave you when you created the Thing -- AWS only shows it once, at
creation time), then save this file as device_key.pem in the same folder.
device_key.pem is gitignored -- it will not be committed. Never share this
file or paste its contents anywhere public: anyone who has it can connect
to AWS IoT Core as this device.
-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----
